      <Notes/>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45360,45528,45804,46092</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Klarth&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Klarth&gt;</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45716,46244,46320</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>エトス</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ethos</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Speakers>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45268</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_019_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ミラルドさんは
&lt;Klarth&gt;さんの奥さんなんですか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Is Mirald your
wife, &lt;Klarth&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45364</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_019_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あいつは単なる助手だ、
そういうのとは違う</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>She's just my assistant. We're
not married, or anything.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45464</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_019_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……え？　でも恋人同士みたいな
話だったし……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Eh? But don't you talk to each
other the same way couples do...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45532</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_019_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>違う。断じて違う</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No. Not at all.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45624</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_019_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……どうしてそんな
むきになるんですか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Why do you seem
kind of upset?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45720</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_019_006&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Mel&gt;、興味本位で
そういうこと聞かないの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Mel&gt;, you shouldn't ask those sorts
of thing just because you're curious.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45808</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_019_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そうだ。君にはまだ
こういう話は早い</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>She's right. You're too young
to think about these things.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45892</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_019_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>早くはないと、思いますけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...But I don't think I'm
too young, though...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46000</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_019_009&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あ……ってことはやっぱり、
おふたりは恋人同士なんですね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah... But if you put it like that, that
definitely means you're a couple, doesn't it?</EnglishText>
      <Notes>needs TL check</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46096</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_019_010&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>どうしてそうなるんだ。
違うと言ったら、違う</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>How do you figure? I told
you we're not, so we're not.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46176</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_019_011&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>じゃあ、どういう関係ですか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then, what kind of
relationship do you have?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46248</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_019_012&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あ、&lt;Mel&gt;ってば……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, &lt;Mel&gt;...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46324</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_019_013&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>もう……女の子なんだかラ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Jeez... She's
such a girl.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
